SUM(IIF(Month(Fields!DATAVENCIMENTO.Value) = 10 AND Fields!GRUPO_CLASSIFIC.Value = 2, (Fields!DEBITO.Value - Fields!CREDITO.Value), NOTHING)) + 0</Value>
                                  <Style>
